  "title": "Cheesy Artichoke Dip by Jean Carper",
  "description": "Here's an easy, lower-fat version of warm artichoke-cheese dip. In new research, artichoke hearts tested surprisingly high in antioxidant activity -- even more per cup than strawberries. Garlic and chives are high in antioxidants, too, and fat-free cottage cheese helps keep the fat and calorie counts down.",
  "authors": [
    "USA WEEKEND - Jean Carper"
  ],
